WEBVTT

00:04.120 --> 00:09.600
A surprising amount of the things 
you see in nature are poisonous.

00:10.740 --> 00:15.510
One might simply make you sick to 
your stomach, or slightly numb...

00:15.510 --> 00:19.030
But combining them together 
and refining the result

00:19.030 --> 00:21.780
will make a poison that can 
kill even a Red Grizzly.

00:22.730 --> 00:25.830
Alchemy's scary...

00:26.230 --> 00:29.280
I know I said I'd help with 
your experiments, but...

00:31.300 --> 00:34.140
Isn't that going to kill me?

02:09.300 --> 02:12.460
Well? Need an antidote spell?

02:12.460 --> 02:17.190
I'm fine. It just tasted terrible.

02:14.860 --> 02:19.070
Undead
Adventurer

02:17.190 --> 02:20.910
You may be the first person in history 
who was able to drink that poison

02:20.910 --> 02:23.280
and say how it tastes, Rentt.

02:24.800 --> 02:27.860
As I thought, no poison will work on you.

02:28.130 --> 02:33.000
But for some reason, healing 
herbs and potions do.

02:34.860 --> 02:37.350
Your body's quite handy.

02:38.490 --> 02:42.780
Wait, do you still not feel the 
need for sleep, even as a ghast?

02:44.070 --> 02:45.170
I don't.

02:45.170 --> 02:47.350
I barely need to sleep at all.

02:47.350 --> 02:49.290
I'm jealous.

02:49.290 --> 02:51.450
What about your appetite?

02:52.590 --> 02:58.140
It's small, but I do feel a desire 
for human flesh and blood.

03:00.870 --> 03:02.610
More poison?

03:02.880 --> 03:04.240
Open it.

03:13.790 --> 03:14.830
Blood!

03:15.500 --> 03:17.530
It's my blood.

03:17.530 --> 03:20.200
I've cast preservation magic on the vial.

03:20.550 --> 03:24.210
You may feel reluctant 
to ingest human blood,

03:24.210 --> 03:28.650
but you should ingest it at regular 
intervals to keep yourself from losing control.

03:30.230 --> 03:31.500
All right.

03:38.230 --> 03:39.630
It's delicious!

03:40.380 --> 03:42.410
You only need one drop?

03:42.410 --> 03:45.900
That's plenty. The thirst is gone.

03:45.900 --> 03:47.920
I'll make it last.

03:51.250 --> 03:53.590
I'm going to head out.

03:53.900 --> 03:55.960
You get some rest, Lorraine.

03:56.200 --> 03:57.550
The labyrinth?

03:57.550 --> 04:00.970
I'm heading to the labyrinth, 
yes, but first, the guild.

04:00.970 --> 04:02.160
The guild?

04:02.160 --> 04:03.750
I'm going to take a job.

04:04.040 --> 04:06.330
You're going to need to show Rentt Faina's

04:06.330 --> 04:09.400
adventurer ID if you want 
a job from the guild.

04:09.400 --> 04:12.920
If you bring it out looking like that, 
the whole guild will be in an uproar.

04:12.920 --> 04:14.220
You think?

04:14.220 --> 04:18.270
Sure, I look different.

04:18.270 --> 04:20.740
But I'm just a Bronze-class adventurer.

04:21.060 --> 04:23.480
Nobody will care.

04:25.390 --> 04:30.730
Listen, Rentt. You're one of 
many Bronze adventurers, yes.

04:30.730 --> 04:33.540
But the guild really liked you.

04:33.870 --> 04:37.420
You did everything from 
helping out new adventurers

04:37.420 --> 04:39.530
to taking jobs nobody else would take.

04:39.780 --> 04:41.660
Those were just random little jobs.

04:41.660 --> 04:44.170
Don't be so hard on yourself.

04:44.170 --> 04:47.710
There was talk of recruiting 
you to work for the guild.

04:48.120 --> 04:49.560
No way.

04:49.560 --> 04:51.260
I don't know anything about that.

04:51.680 --> 04:56.340
Maybe if I were a really talented 
adventurer, but I'm not...

04:56.950 --> 05:00.260
They probably found it hard 
to bring the subject up,

05:00.260 --> 05:02.570
since you showed no signs of retiring.

05:02.830 --> 05:04.850
How do you know?

05:04.850 --> 05:07.840
Even I know some people at the guild.

05:08.830 --> 05:11.030
I'm grateful they thought that.

05:11.300 --> 05:16.040
But I'm not going to retire, 
or work at the guild.

05:16.040 --> 05:17.700
That's what we all assumed.

05:18.430 --> 05:20.340
Now, let's think about this.

05:20.340 --> 05:23.270
You need to pass a test to go up a rank.

05:23.270 --> 05:25.840
And to take that test, you 
need to prove yourself.

05:25.840 --> 05:30.360
You need to be the one taking the quests.

05:31.630 --> 05:36.470
But if the guild knows that 
Rentt Faina is back...

05:37.480 --> 05:38.710
Rentt!

05:39.110 --> 05:42.060
Just be somebody else!

05:54.520 --> 05:56.690
<i>It feels like it's been a long time.</i>

06:00.680 --> 06:02.310
<i>Oh, there's Sheila!</i>

06:02.810 --> 06:03.970
<i>Looks like she's doing well.</i>

06:05.440 --> 06:08.250
Good morning. Is it your first time here?

06:11.050 --> 06:13.710
I want to register as an adventurer.

06:13.710 --> 06:18.020
All right. You'll need to do some paperwork.

06:18.020 --> 06:21.970
I can fill out all of it except your name.

06:21.970 --> 06:23.990
I know how to read and write.

06:23.990 --> 06:25.600
My apologies.

06:25.600 --> 06:28.240
You can leave any parts that 
are too hard for you blank.

06:28.240 --> 06:31.480
But if you put down any skills 
you have or magic you can use,

06:31.480 --> 06:33.860
we'll be able to give you more jobs.

06:34.260 --> 06:37.710
<i>The last time I filled this 
out was 10 years ago.</i>

06:37.710 --> 06:41.260
<i>Back then, I didn't even know 
what counted as a "skill,"</i>

06:41.260 --> 06:43.870
<i>and I could only write down my name and age.</i>

06:44.450 --> 06:46.380
<i>Not like now.</i>

06:46.930 --> 06:51.150
<i>But my goal hasn't changed 
at all since then.</i>

06:52.170 --> 06:56.680
Rentt, why not register as an 
adventurer under another name?

06:56.680 --> 07:00.570
I can't do that! Using two different 
names is against the guild rules!

07:00.570 --> 07:03.180
They'll never know.

07:03.180 --> 07:06.220
And even if they do find out, 
it won't be a big deal.

07:06.660 --> 07:09.030
Everyone knows Rentt Faina, and they'd have

07:09.030 --> 07:12.190
no end of questions about 
how you ended up that way.

07:12.460 --> 07:16.770
But nobody will ask questions 
about a wandering adventurer,

07:16.770 --> 07:19.210
no matter how strange they look.

07:19.790 --> 07:21.300
True.

07:21.300 --> 07:25.280
Well, you'll lose what 
accomplishments Rentt Faina had,

07:25.280 --> 07:30.480
and you'll have to start over from Iron.

07:30.480 --> 07:31.740
I don't mind.

07:32.240 --> 07:33.920
My goal is...

07:34.500 --> 07:38.460
to become a Mythril-class 
adventurer someday. That's all.

07:39.060 --> 07:40.840
Thank you.

07:43.380 --> 07:46.260
Your name is... Rentt Vivier, correct?

07:47.120 --> 07:48.180
What's wrong?

07:48.180 --> 07:54.950
Nothing, just... an adventurer named 
Rentt went missing the other day.

07:55.410 --> 07:57.980
<i>She was worried? About somebody like me?</i>

07:58.520 --> 08:00.860
<i>Well, we did know each 
other for a long time.</i>

08:00.860 --> 08:05.150
I'm sorry. It just surprised 
me that you had the same name.

08:05.150 --> 08:06.630
I see.

08:06.630 --> 08:09.500
By the way, was that Rentt Faina?

08:10.170 --> 08:12.960
Yes, but how did you know?

08:13.270 --> 08:15.310
Lorraine told me.

08:16.310 --> 08:20.000
Are you a relative of hers?

08:20.000 --> 08:22.970
Yes. She's letting me stay with her.

08:23.290 --> 08:27.970
I'd heard that an unusual-looking man 
was seen going in and out of her home.

08:27.970 --> 08:29.560
So that was you, huh?

08:30.130 --> 08:32.550
<i>There were rumors about me, huh?</i>

08:33.800 --> 08:36.770
I was so sure it was Rentt Faina.

08:37.230 --> 08:41.040
He seemed so close to her.

08:43.050 --> 08:46.030
All right. This paperwork looks fine.

08:46.030 --> 08:48.280
Give me a minute to finish this up.

08:51.020 --> 08:54.430
<i>I'm glad I said I was a relative.</i>

08:54.430 --> 08:56.590
<i>Lorraine is a young woman.</i>

08:56.590 --> 08:59.370
<i>I need to make sure there aren't 
weird rumors about her.</i>

08:59.920 --> 09:03.940
<i>The name "Rentt" is a common 
one in every country.</i>

09:04.330 --> 09:08.380
<i>And it's not unusual for an adventurer 
to look a little strange.</i>

09:08.860 --> 09:11.260
<i>Now I can start over!</i>

09:12.050 --> 09:13.640
Rentt Vivier!

09:13.640 --> 09:15.310
Oh, yes?

09:15.570 --> 09:18.690
You are now an Iron-class adventurer.

09:18.690 --> 09:20.400
Do your best!

09:20.740 --> 09:22.150
Thank you.

09:22.150 --> 09:25.890
Just... don't get yourself killed.

09:26.790 --> 09:27.720
Thanks.

09:42.460 --> 09:43.760
<i>Goblins?</i>

09:45.150 --> 09:46.530
Ryze, behind you!

09:47.140 --> 09:48.630
<i>Still young...</i>

09:48.630 --> 09:50.370
<i>They sound like children.</i>

09:59.580 --> 10:02.670
<i>A swordsman and a healer.</i>

10:02.670 --> 10:05.040
<i>Given their age, they must be new.</i>

10:08.690 --> 10:09.320
<i>Laura!</i>

10:09.320 --> 10:10.330
<i>Right!</i>

10:14.930 --> 10:17.300
<i>They seem to be working well together.</i>

10:17.300 --> 10:18.690
<i>They'll probably be fine.</i>

10:19.420 --> 10:23.960
<i>I used to always talk to the 
new kids, show them around...</i>

10:23.960 --> 10:26.810
<i>But I'd just scare them, looking like this.</i>

10:31.550 --> 10:37.160
<i>Now, then... time to hurry before the 
other adventurers find that place.</i>

10:45.740 --> 10:48.990
<i>Information about the labyrinth 
is valuable, and worth money.</i>

10:48.990 --> 10:52.920
<i>Especially information about 
newly discovered areas.</i>

10:53.700 --> 10:57.290
<i>If I can explore this new area 
and report it to the guild,</i>

10:57.290 --> 10:59.490
<i>it'll be a huge accomplishment.</i>

11:00.210 --> 11:03.490
<i>For the Iron-class 
adventurer, Rentt Vivier.</i>

11:04.250 --> 11:08.010
<i>Now, let's see what's waiting for me...</i>

11:34.690 --> 11:37.070
<i>That's not an undead...</i>

11:38.230 --> 11:43.490
<i>Somebody was living here? 
Inside the labyrinth?</i>

11:43.980 --> 11:48.050
What are you doing?

11:54.040 --> 11:55.870
I'll ask you one more time.

11:56.480 --> 12:00.210
What are you doing?

12:01.080 --> 12:04.300
<i>Oh no... this woman's bad news!</i>

12:04.940 --> 12:08.800
I was searching to see if 
there was anything here.

12:08.800 --> 12:10.910
I'm an adventurer.

12:10.910 --> 12:13.870
Searching, you say?

12:13.870 --> 12:15.410
Searching...

12:15.410 --> 12:18.210
For something to steal, correct?

12:19.050 --> 12:22.660
Does that mean you're 
prepared to die down here?

12:24.030 --> 12:27.080
There are some things even I can't forgive.

12:27.660 --> 12:30.280
I don't want this place disturbed.

12:32.930 --> 12:36.120
So... disappear, please.

13:02.230 --> 13:04.580
Your body...

13:04.880 --> 13:06.540
Does it offend you?

13:07.190 --> 13:11.300
I didn't end up like this 
because I wanted to.

13:15.340 --> 13:17.320
I assume so.

13:17.320 --> 13:22.330
But at least it explains how you got here.

13:23.560 --> 13:26.620
It seems I've misunderstood you.

13:26.620 --> 13:28.290
My apologies.

13:29.040 --> 13:31.500
Oh, you're upset, aren't you?

13:31.500 --> 13:34.000
I burnt your clothes.

13:34.000 --> 13:37.330
<i>No, you almost killed me!</i>

13:37.560 --> 13:39.990
In exchange...

13:45.650 --> 13:47.660
I'll offer you this.

13:48.450 --> 13:52.510
It's well-made, and worth more 
than what you were wearing.

13:54.060 --> 13:56.440
<i>She said she "misunderstood" me, right?</i>

13:56.710 --> 14:00.380
<i>Does that mean she doesn't 
feel like killing me anymore?</i>

14:03.210 --> 14:06.850
I'm sure you understand that 
this place is special.

14:07.080 --> 14:11.430
Would you be willing to keep it a secret?

14:12.040 --> 14:16.460
This room is a special place to me.

14:17.450 --> 14:19.530
You mean don't tell the guild?

14:19.530 --> 14:22.720
Yes, that's correct.

14:22.720 --> 14:26.910
Though, actually, no one can enter 
this place unless you're with them.

14:28.030 --> 14:32.670
Oh, if you're an adventurer, you wouldn't 
want to go home empty-handed, would you?

14:33.150 --> 14:36.820
I'll give you this Acacia Map instead.

14:36.820 --> 14:39.310
I'm sure it will be of use to you.

14:46.320 --> 14:47.510
A map?

14:48.060 --> 14:54.570
It's a magic item that will automatically record 
the spaces through which its owner has traveled.

14:55.270 --> 14:59.320
Our trade is now complete, yes?

15:00.360 --> 15:03.630
I'll return you to the entrance, then.

15:04.770 --> 15:09.810
I wish you good health... Though perhaps 
that's not the best thing to say to you.

15:19.530 --> 15:22.350
Are you under some kind of curse?

15:22.350 --> 15:25.560
The strangest things keep 
happening to you...

15:25.560 --> 15:28.520
I'm not running into them 
because I want to...

15:28.520 --> 15:31.220
And that's why I said it was a curse.

15:31.220 --> 15:36.300
Well, an adventurer's job is 
going to see strange things.

15:36.720 --> 15:40.680
Anyway, this magic item... 
it doesn't seem cursed.

15:40.680 --> 15:42.420
It seems safe to use.

15:42.710 --> 15:45.250
Any idea how to use it?

15:45.250 --> 15:48.830
It didn't react to my magic at all.

15:48.830 --> 15:51.470
You try it, Rentt.

15:58.850 --> 16:01.060
This is the Labyrinth of 
the Moon's Reflection.

16:01.060 --> 16:03.220
It really is a map.

16:03.220 --> 16:04.990
Amazing.

16:05.770 --> 16:07.560
What's this mark?

16:08.200 --> 16:09.410
I'm not sure...

16:12.930 --> 16:15.550
"Ryze" and "Laura"...

16:16.050 --> 16:19.320
Those seem to be names, but what is this?

16:19.320 --> 16:21.370
A pair of rookie adventurers.

16:21.370 --> 16:23.500
I met them in the labyrinth.

16:23.500 --> 16:28.900
Then it's showing you the names of the people 
in the labyrinth, as well as their positions?

16:28.900 --> 16:30.250
That's handy.

16:30.250 --> 16:33.760
Rentt, this is incredible!

16:33.760 --> 16:35.510
It's a potential national treasure!

16:35.800 --> 16:37.460
I can't believe this...

16:37.460 --> 16:39.580
Can you bring up maps for 
the other labyrinths?

16:39.580 --> 16:41.640
I'm not sure...

16:41.640 --> 16:43.860
Other labyrinths...

16:43.860 --> 16:46.380
The Labyrinth of the New Moon, maybe?

16:50.230 --> 16:51.870
It changed!

16:51.870 --> 16:54.640
But it's not complete.

16:54.640 --> 16:55.970
It's not?

16:55.970 --> 16:56.950
It's not.

16:56.950 --> 17:02.200
Actually, she said it would record the 
spaces in the labyrinth that I'd traveled.

17:03.360 --> 17:09.250
So it won't display any areas that its
owner, that is, you, haven't been to?

17:09.590 --> 17:13.130
Hey, can you take a look at this robe, too?

17:13.130 --> 17:15.690
I don't want another curse.

17:15.690 --> 17:17.330
It's fine.

17:17.330 --> 17:19.260
You already have it equipped.

17:19.260 --> 17:21.650
If it was cursed, you'd know by now.

17:25.190 --> 17:28.220
From the look of it, it's of good quality.

17:28.220 --> 17:29.490
It is?

17:29.490 --> 17:33.370
Yes. It has extremely 
strong magic resistance,

17:33.370 --> 17:35.170
and no blade could pierce it.

17:35.170 --> 17:39.450
You can safely assume it's far 
stronger than regular armor.

17:39.820 --> 17:42.960
Maybe I got a better deal 
out of this than I thought.

17:42.960 --> 17:45.990
Rentt, that's not what you 
need to be thinking about.

17:46.560 --> 17:51.130
Who is this woman who almost killed you?

17:52.420 --> 17:53.840
I don't know.

17:54.770 --> 17:57.080
She was incredibly powerful.

17:57.950 --> 18:04.200
But at my level of strength, all I can say 
is that she's stronger than a Gold-class.

18:04.200 --> 18:05.330
I see.

18:05.790 --> 18:08.750
I'm curious about the room you went to, too.

18:09.090 --> 18:14.040
It means somebody has the ability to make 
living spaces within the labyrinth.

18:14.040 --> 18:16.540
I'm going back tomorrow.

18:16.540 --> 18:18.430
Even though you were almost killed?

18:18.430 --> 18:20.000
That's brave.

18:20.000 --> 18:22.770
She didn't tell me to never come back.

18:22.770 --> 18:25.570
She just told me not to tell the guild.

18:25.570 --> 18:27.490
You don't know if that's how she sees it.

18:27.760 --> 18:33.510
From what you said, she clearly 
wants to be left alone.

18:34.310 --> 18:37.610
Well, I'll go talk to her, at least.

18:42.180 --> 18:44.780
I'm cursed, huh?

18:48.330 --> 18:52.460
<i>What Lorraine said was right.</i>

18:52.460 --> 18:57.280
<i>On the day I found that new area in the 
Labyrinth of the Moon's Reflection...</i>

18:57.280 --> 19:00.170
<i>I met the dragon and became undead.</i>

19:00.900 --> 19:03.460
<i>I still can't get this cursed mask off.</i>

19:03.900 --> 19:06.500
<i>Most people would take pity on me.</i>

19:07.220 --> 19:10.280
<i>But... I don't feel that way at all.</i>

19:13.310 --> 19:18.820
<i>I've fought powerful enemies, encountered 
many mysteries... and gotten stronger.</i>

19:19.460 --> 19:23.970
<i>That's just what a Mythril-class 
adventurer does!</i>

19:34.860 --> 19:35.820
It's not here.

19:36.300 --> 19:39.660
The entrance is gone?

19:47.620 --> 19:50.880
<i>So she doesn't want me coming back?</i>

19:52.240 --> 19:56.390
<i>No, she doesn't want me 
coming back right now.</i>

19:58.670 --> 20:00.500
Welcome back.

20:00.790 --> 20:03.740
The client was very happy.

20:03.740 --> 20:05.340
I'm glad to hear that.

20:05.700 --> 20:09.050
Hey, have you heard anything about Rentt?

20:09.580 --> 20:11.270
Nothing, yet.

20:11.270 --> 20:12.650
I see...

20:12.650 --> 20:15.980
Well, maybe he went off to escort 
some traveler or something, right?

20:16.370 --> 20:18.700
Tell me if you ever hear something.

20:18.700 --> 20:19.730
Okay.

20:20.560 --> 20:25.070
<i>Rentt, everyone is worried about you.</i>

20:25.680 --> 20:31.140
<i>A lot of people learned how 
to be an adventurer from you.</i>

20:31.710 --> 20:36.360
<i>I only learned how to be a real 
guild employee thanks to you...</i>

20:37.410 --> 20:39.260
I'm "nice"?

20:39.260 --> 20:40.270
Yes.

20:40.270 --> 20:42.460
I've never seen myself that way...

20:42.720 --> 20:46.670
But well, I'll do anything if 
it helps me become Mythril.

20:50.320 --> 20:51.210
Excuse me...

20:52.970 --> 20:55.140
I'm sorry!

20:55.140 --> 20:58.400
I was just thinking about something, 
and you startled me...

20:58.810 --> 21:01.310
That's fine... actually...

21:01.750 --> 21:03.740
I want to take this job.

21:04.820 --> 21:08.020
Three bodies' worth of orc flesh?

21:08.020 --> 21:11.590
The deadline's not for a while, but...

21:11.930 --> 21:16.970
Orcs are quite strong. And you'll 
need to fight three of them.

21:16.970 --> 21:19.530
I can't recommend that for 
an Iron-class adventurer.

21:19.530 --> 21:21.970
I know how strong orcs are.

21:22.390 --> 21:27.800
You'd need to be an average Bronze-class, 
no, a fairly strong one.

21:27.800 --> 21:28.830
Then...

21:28.830 --> 21:33.140
Don't worry. I've defeated 
orcs before, several times.

21:33.580 --> 21:35.360
I see.

21:35.360 --> 21:38.370
If you've already fought them, then...

21:38.810 --> 21:43.280
The guild will entrust you, 
Rentt Vivier, with this job.

21:44.090 --> 21:45.290
I accept.

21:45.910 --> 21:48.430
Just don't do anything risky, okay?

21:48.430 --> 21:50.700
If it gets dangerous, then run away.

21:50.700 --> 21:51.780
Got it?

21:52.080 --> 21:55.950
Yes. I've only got one life, after all.

21:55.950 --> 21:57.400
I understand that.

21:57.400 --> 21:58.260
No...

22:00.350 --> 22:03.490
I think I understand that 
better than anyone.

23:35.640 --> 23:39.970
Bronze-class Exam
